      "section": "推荐检索路径",
      "text": "```text\nSKILL.md → KITS.md / TASK_MAP.md → INDEX.md → 目标文档\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装方式",
      "text": "- Gemini CLI：`gemini skills install https://github.com/linhay/harmony-next.skills --path harmony-next --scope user`\n- Claude Code：`npx skills add linhay/harmony-next.skills --skill harmony-next -a claude-code -g -y --copy`\n- Codex：`npx skills add linhay/harmony-next.skills --skill harmony-next -a codex -g -y --copy`\n- DSH：`dsh plugin --profile demo add github:linhay/harmony-next.skills`\n\nDeepSeek Harness (DSH) 使用 filesystem skill；该 bundle 不安装 MCP、tools 或 apps。本仓库当前还不是 Codex plugin。"
    },
